# Citation metadata. Zenodo reads this file when a release is archived, and GitHub
# renders it as "Cite this repository". .mailmap only normalises how git reports
# history; nothing reads it here.
#
# `version` must match Cargo.toml - scripts/test-citation.sh fails the build on
# drift, because a deposition archived under the wrong version cannot be corrected
# by editing the source afterwards.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "KYB (Know Your Business): Git-backed knowledge base and incident tracker for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  A git-backed, searchable knowledge base and incident tracker for fleets of AI
  agents. Every entry is a markdown file and every change a commit, so superseded
  versions stay retrievable and searchable rather than being overwritten. Search
  is hybrid: BM25 fused by reciprocal rank with a multilingual embedding model
  running locally on CPU.
type: software
authors:
